        "title": "Apple rolling out RC for iPadOS 27.2, watchOS 27.2, and more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/apple-rolling-out-rc-for-ipados-27-2-watchos-27-2-and-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/ios-27-apple-product-devices-lineup-bg.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is rolling out RC (release candidate) versions of iPadOS 27.2, watchOS 27.2, and more. Here’s what that means.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ipados-27,ipados-27-2\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074794\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/apple-rolling-out-rc-for-ipados-27-2-watchos-27-2-and-more/#more-1074794\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
