        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/car-keys-in-apple-wallet-coming-soon-to-three-popular-vehicle-brands/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/apple-wallet-ios-27-app-icon-colors.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Wallet car keys are about to get a big expansion, with <a href=\"https://news.gm.com/home.detail.html/Pages/topic/us/en/2026/sep/0923-key-digital-wallet.html\">GM announcing</a> support for a variety of vehicles across three of its popular brands: Cadillac, Chevrolet, and GMC.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-wallet,carkey\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074764\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/car-keys-in-apple-wallet-coming-soon-to-three-popular-vehicle-brands/#more-1074764\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
