        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27.2-rc.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is rolling out the first RC for macOS 27.2 for developers and users enrolled in the public beta, ahead of the official release in the next few weeks. Here’s what to expect.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"macos,macos-27,macos-27-2\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074770\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/first-release-candidate-for-macos-27-2-golden-gate-now-available/#more-1074770\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
