        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/hands-on-pokemon-x-beats-pill-is-one-of-my-favorite-collabs-yet-video/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/pokemon-beats.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As someone who loves all things Apple and Pokémon, I never thought these worlds would collide, but here we are! Beats and the Pokémon Company have officially teamed up for a <a href=\"https://howl.link/ne4708h65z8oz\">special edition Beats Pill</a>, and man, did they nail this. This new collab features both Pikachu and Mimikyu, bringing a two-tone design, unique accessories, and some awesome attention to detail in a speaker that we know and love. I have been using mine for a few days and wanted to share my thoughts as a fan of both brands in this collaboration. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"beats,beats-pill,pokemon\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074321\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/hands-on-pokemon-x-beats-pill-is-one-of-my-favorite-collabs-yet-video/#more-1074321\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
