        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"597\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?fit=1024%2C597&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?w=2400&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=300%2C175&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=1024%2C597&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=768%2C448&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=1536%2C896&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=2048%2C1195&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=1200%2C700&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=2000%2C1167&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=780%2C455&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=400%2C233&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?resize=706%2C412&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?w=2340&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7.png?fit=1024%2C597&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure><p>Stories on the color orange, the data center rush, a local hero, the AI labor takeover, and a boy dinner subreddit. </p>\n \t\t<div class=\"woocommerce\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"woocommerce-info wc-memberships-restriction-message wc-memberships-message wc-memberships-content-restricted-message\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://longreads.com/join/\"><img src=\"https://longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/members-only-graphic.png\" alt=\"sorry, this post is only available to Longreads members. To become a member, visit longreads.com/join.\"></a>\t\t    </div>\n\t\t</div>",
